{"lang":"sw","dir":"ltr","text":{"credits.donateTitle":"Saidia kujifunza kuendelee kuwa bure","credits.donateButton":"Saidia AOSSIE","credits.data":"Data","credits.photos":"Picha za miji mikuu","madeBy":"imetengenezwa na"},"html":{"credits.lead":"Memo ni programu huria na ya bure kutoka <a href=\"https://aossie.org/\">AOSSIE</a>.","credits.source":"Msimbo chanzo: <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame\">github.com/AOSSIE-Org/Memo-EducationalGame</a>.","credits.donateText":"AOSSIE ni shirika lisilo la faida. Memo haina matangazo, haina usajili wa kulipia na haikusanyi data yako kamwe — na tunataka iendelee kuwa hivyo kwa kila mtoto, kila mahali. Ikiwa Memo imewafanya watoto wako wawe na hamu ya kujua kuhusu dunia, tafadhali fikiria kutununulia kikombe cha kahawa: kila mchango, hata ukiwa mdogo kiasi gani, hutusaidia kutengeneza na kudumisha programu zaidi za elimu za bure. Michango ya msimbo, mawazo, tafsiri na maoni inakaribishwa vilevile!","credits.shapes":"Picha za maumbo: zimechorwa kwa ajili ya Memo, ni huru kutumia kama sehemu nyingine za programu.","credits.capitals":"Miji mikuu na picha zake: kutoka <a href=\"https://github.com/AOSSIE-Org/FlagQuiz\">Flag Quiz</a>, inayozichukua kutoka <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0) na <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>.","credits.names":"Majina ya nchi katika lugha nyingine: <a href=\"https://cldr.unicode.org/\">Unicode CLDR</a> (<a href=\"https://www.unicode.org/license.txt\">Unicode License v3</a>); majina ya miji mikuu: <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/\">Wikidata</a> (CC0).","credits.photosNote":"Picha zote zinatoka <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, zimebadilishwa ukubwa na kukatwa. Fuata viungo ili kuona picha asili na masharti kamili ya leseni."},"capitals":{"AD":"Andorra la Vella","AE":"Abu Dhabi","AF":"Kabul","AG":"St. John's","AL":"Tirana","AM":"Yerevan","AO":"Luanda","AR":"Buenos Aires","AS":"Pago Pago","A